# Modules allowed to name the node backend (tools/node_confinement_check.sh).
# One per line: <path from the repository root>: <why it must>.
# A spec is exempt only as a backend's own test: "<spec path>: own test of
# <backend session or adapter module path> — <why>"; it must name what that
# module defines.
offchain/cli/src/Singular/CLI/Node.hs: composition — resolves the node settings once and opens the read interface, the signed-only write and the confirmation the commands are handed
offchain/lib/Singular/Registry/Node.hs: runner startup — opens the session a runner's mode names and hands the runner its capabilities (withCapabilities, withExternalCapabilities); re-exports session opening for the fixtures below
offchain/devnet/Devnet/Probe.hs: composition — the devnet probe reads a node's raw ledger snapshot and its UTxO by output reference, which the read interface does not answer, over its own node-to-client connection
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/Fixture.hs: fixture startup — spawns the end-to-end devnet, follows it with the indexer and hands the specs their capabilities
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/NodeSpec.hs: own test of offchain/node-internal/Singular/Registry/Node/Session.hs — opens external-node sessions by mode against a real devnet to test the handshake, magic refusal, reads and confirmation of the session itself
conformance/app/Conformance/Run/Node.hs: composition — opens the conformance harness's node (the spawned, indexed devnet or the external node) and hands every row its capabilities
conformance/app-cli/Conformance/Cli/Node.hs: composition — opens the CLI controls backend's one external-node session and hands every action its capabilities
conformance/app/Conformance/Run/Replay.hs: composition — replays a refused submission with traced validators: wraps the raw submitter so each refusal is captured before the next submission, and reads the refused transaction's inputs by output reference, the protocol parameters and the era history over node-to-client, which the read interface does not answer
